flowchart LR
    subgraph Client[利用者ブラウザ]
        React[React + TypeScript UI]
    end

    subgraph Edge[公開エッジ境界]
        CF[CloudFront]
        UI[S3 UIバケット<br/>Block Public Access + OAC]
    end

    subgraph Identity[認証境界]
        Cognito[Amazon Cognito<br/>User Pool / JWT]
    end

    subgraph Control[コントロールプレーン]
        APIGW[API Gateway<br/>JWT Authorizer]
        API[Lambda API<br/>認可・状態遷移]
        Dispatcher[Lambda Dispatcher / Reconciler<br/>Phase 3 planned / not provisioned]
        EB[Amazon EventBridge<br/>Phase 3 planned / not provisioned<br/>定期確認・起動漏れ検知のみ]
        DDB[DynamoDB<br/>Patch / File / Execution / Approval / Audit / Outbox]
        SQLS3[S3 SQLバケット<br/>非公開・Versioning・暗号化]
        LogS3[S3 Logバケット<br/>非公開・Versioning・暗号化]
        KMS[AWS KMS]
    end

    subgraph Execution[実行境界: 環境ごとに分離]
        CB[CodeBuild managed service<br/>Phase 2: Fail-Closed / SQL runnerはPhase 3 planned<br/>VPC build ENI・環境別IAMロール]
        Secret[Secrets Manager<br/>Phase 3 planned: 環境別DB Secret]
        RDS[(RDS for PostgreSQL<br/>Private Subnet)]
        Guard[実行ガード / DB実行台帳<br/>条件付き更新]
    end

    React -->|静的ファイル| CF
    CF -->|OAC| UI
    React -->|ログイン| Cognito
    React -->|JWT付きAPI| APIGW
    APIGW -->|claims| API
    API -->|Patch状態・ハッシュ・監査| DDB
    API -->|短期PUT署名URL| React
    React -->|SQL本文を直接PUT| SQLS3
    API -->|完了時HeadObject・VersionId・SHA-256検証| SQLS3
    API -->|短期GET署名URL| React
    React -->|API発行の短期GET URLで取得| LogS3
    API -->|Execution + OutboxをTransactWriteItems| DDB
    EB -->|定期確認・起動漏れ検知<br/>SQL再実行なし| Dispatcher
    DDB -->|Outbox poll + 条件付きlease| Dispatcher
    Dispatcher -->|StartBuild + idempotency token| CB
    Dispatcher -->|状態・リース・監査| DDB
    CB -->|Phase 3 planned: VersionId指定取得| SQLS3
    CB -->|Phase 3 planned: Secret取得| Secret
    CB -->|Phase 3 planned: 条件付きguard| Guard
    CB -->|Phase 3 planned: TLS 5432 / SQL実行| RDS
    CB -->|Phase 3 planned: 結果ログ新規キーPut| LogS3
    CB -->|Phase 3 planned: 実行状態・結果キー| DDB
    SQLS3 -.->|SSE-S3 / 社内導入時SSE-KMS| KMS
    LogS3 -.->|SSE-S3 / 社内導入時SSE-KMS| KMS

    classDef boundary fill:#eef5ff,stroke:#4c78a8,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef sensitive fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#cc7a00,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef execution fill:#eaf7ea,stroke:#3a8f3a,stroke-width:1px;
    class Edge,Identity,Control,Execution boundary;
    class SQLS3,LogS3,Secret,RDS sensitive;
    class CB,Guard execution;
